      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countKeyChanges(s):\n    if len(s) <= 1:\n        return 0\n    \n    changes = 0\n    for i in range(1, len(s)):\n        # Convert both current and previous characters to lowercase for comparison\n        prev_char = s[i-1].lower()\n        curr_char = s[i].lower()\n        \n        # If the lowercase versions are different, it's a key change\n        if prev_char != curr_char:\n            changes += 1\n    \n    return changes\n```",
