          # Case 5: face on z = z2 of cuboid i touches z = c1 of cuboid j\n            if z2 == c1:\n                if max(x1, a1) < min(x2, a2) and max(y1, b1) < min(y2, b2):\n                    count +=  tensor\n                    continue\n            # Case 6: face on z = z1 of cuboid i touches z = c2 of cuboid j\n            if z1 == c2:\n                if max(x1, a1) < min(x2, a2) and max(y1, b1) < min(y2, b2):\n                    count += 1\n                    continue\n        \n        result.append(count)\n    \n    for res in result:\n        print(res)\n\nmain()\n```",
