      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef sortVowels(s):\n    vowels = set('aeiouAEIOU')\n    s_vowels = []\n    \n    # Extract all vowels from the string\n    for char in s:\n        if char in vowels:\n            s_vowels.append(char)\n    \n    # Sort vowels by ASCII value\n    s_vowels.sort()\n    \n    # Reconstruct the string with sorted vowels\n    result = []\n    vowel_index = 0\n    \n    for char in s:\n        if char in vowels:\n            result.append(s_vowels[vowel_index])\n            vowel_index += 1\n        else:\n            result.append(char)\n    \n    return ''.join(result)\n```",
