      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countBeautifulIntegers(low, high, k):\n    def count_even_odd_digits(n):\n        even_count = 0\n        odd_count = 0\n        for digit in str(n):\n            d = int(digit)\n            if d % 2 == 0:\n                even_count += 1\n            else:\n                odd_count += 1\n        return even_count, odd_count\n    \n    count = 0\n    for num in range(low, high + 1):\n        even_count, odd_count = count_even_odd_digits(num)\n        if even_count == odd_count and num % k == 0:\n            count += 1\n    \n    return count\n```",
