    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minExtraChar(s, dictionary):\n    n = len(s)\n    # Convert dictionary to set for O(1) lookup\n    word_set = set(dictionary)\n    \n    # dp[i] represents the minimum extra characters for the substring s[0:i]\n    dp = [float('inf')] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0  # Base case: empty string has 0 extra characters\n    \n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        # Option 1: Treat current character as extra\n        dp[i] = dp[i - 1] + 1\n        \n        # Option 2: Try to form words ending at position i\n        for j in range(i):\n            substring = s[j:i]\n            if substring in word_set:\n                dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[j])\n    \n    return dp[n]\n```",
