    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimize_partitions(s):\n    n = len(s)\n    \n    def is_balanced(substr):\n        if not substr:\n            return False\n        freq = {}\n        for char in substr:\n            freq[char] = freq.get(char, 0) + 1\n        return len(set(freq.values())) == 1\n    \n    # dp[i] represents the minimum number of partitions for s[:i]\n    dp = [float('inf')] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    \n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        for j in range(i):\n            if is_balanced(s[j:i]):\n                dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[j] + 1)\n    \n    return dp[n]\n```",
