ot pass or rest on (3,4).\n\nSample Input 2\n\n21 25\r\n#########################\r\n#..............###...####\r\n#..............#..#...###\r\n#........###...#...#...##\r\n#........#..#..#........#\r\n#...##...#..#..#...#....#\r\n#..#..#..###...#..#.....#\r\n#..#..#..#..#..###......#\r\n#..####..#..#...........#\r\n#..#..#..###............#\r\n#..#..#.................#\r\n#........##.............#\r\n#.......#..#............#\r\n#..........#....#.......#\r\n#........###...##....#..#\r\n#..........#..#.#...##..#\r\n#.......#..#....#..#.#..#\r\n##.......##.....#....#..#\r\n###.............#....#..#\r\n####.................#..#\r\n#########################\n\nSample Output 2\n\n215",
