arwedge1)\\barwedge0=0\\barwedge0=1\\neq0=1\\barwedge1=1\\barwedge(1\\barwedge0).\n\nSample Input 2\n\n30\r\n101010000100101011010011000010\n\nSample Output 2\n\n326",
