      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef findPermutationDifference(s, t):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculate the permutation difference between two strings s and t.\n    \n    Args:\n        s (str): First string where each character occurs at most once\n        t (str): Second string, a permutation of s\n    \n    Returns:\n        int: The sum of absolute differences between indices of each character in s and t\n    \"\"\"\n    # Create a dictionary to store the index of each character in string t\n    t_indices = {}\n    for i, char in enumerate(t):\n        t_indices[char] = i\n    \n    # Calculate the permutation difference\n    diff = 0\n    for i, char in enumerate(s):\n        diff += abs(i - t_indices[char])\n    \n    return diff\n```",
