      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumStrongPairXor(nums):\n    max_xor = 0\n    n = len(nums)\n    \n    # Check all pairs (i, j) including when i = j\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(n):\n            x, y = nums[i], nums[j]\n            # Check if the pair is a strong pair\n            if abs(x - y) <= min(x, y):\n                # Update maximum XOR if this is a strong pair\n                max_xor = max(max_xor, x ^ y)\n    \n    return max_xor\n```",
