    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    t = int(input())\n    \n    for _ in range(t):\n        n = int(input())\n        a = list(map(int, input().split()))\n        \n        max_sum = a[0]  # Initialize with first element\n        \n        # Try all possible subarrays\n        for i in range(n):\n            current_sum = 0\n            for j in range(i, n):\n                # Check if we are at the start of the subarray or if parities alternate\n                if j == i or (a[j] % 2 != a[j-1] % 2):\n                    current_sum += a[j]\n                    # Update max_sum for non-empty subarray\n                    if j >= i:\n                        max_sum = max(max_sum, current_sum)\n                else:\n                    # Parities don't alternate, break the subarray\n                    break\n        \n        print(max_sum)\n\nsolve()\n```",
