      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countTestedDevices(batteryPercentages):\n    n = len(batteryPercentages)\n    tested_count = 0\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        # Check if current device's battery percentage is greater than 0\n        if batteryPercentages[i] > 0:\n            # Increment the count of tested devices\n            tested_count += 1\n            \n            # Decrease battery percentage of all devices with indices j in range [i+1, n-1] by 1\n            for j in range(i + 1, n):\n                batteryPercentages[j] = max(0, batteryPercentages[j] - 1)\n    \n    return tested_count\n```",
