      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef longestCommonPrefix(arr1, arr2):\n    # Convert all numbers to strings for easier prefix manipulation\n    str_arr1 = [str(x) for x in arr1]\n    str_arr2 = [str(x) for x in arr2]\n    \n    max_length = 0\n    \n    # For each number in arr1, compare with each number in arr2\n    for s1 in str_arr1:\n        for s2 in str_arr2:\n            # Find the common prefix length between s1 and s2\n            common_len = 0\n            min_len = min(len(s1), len(s2))\n            \n            for i in range(min_len):\n                if s1[i] == s2[i]:\n                    common_len += 1\n                else:\n                    break\n            \n            # Update maximum length found so far\n            max_length = max(max_length, common_len)\n    \n    return max_length\n```",
