      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    N = int(sys.stdin.readline())\n    Q = list(map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split()))\n    A = list(map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split()))\n    B = list(map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split()))\n    \n    # Find the maximum possible number of servings of dish A we can make\n    max_servings_A = float('inf')\n    for i in range(N):\n        if A[i] > 0:\n            max_servings_A = min(max_servings_A, Q[i] // A[i])\n    if max_servings_A == float('inf'):\n        max_servings_A = 0\n    \n    # Try all possible numbers of servings of dish A\n    max_total_servings = 0\n    for servings_A in range(max_servings_A + 1):\n        # Calculate remaining ingredients after making 'servings_A' of dish A\n        remaining = [Q[i] - servings_A * A[i] for i in range(N)]\n        \n        # Calculate how many servings of dish B we can make with remaining ingredients\n        max_servings_B = float('inf')\n        for i in range(N):\n            if B[i] > 0:\n                max_servings_B = min(max_servings_B, remaining[i] // B[i])\n        \n        if max_servings_B == float('inf'):\n            max_servings_B = 0\n            \n        total_servings = servings_A + max_servings_B\n        max_total_servings = max(max_total_servings, total_servings)\n    \n    print(max_total_servings)\n\nsolve()\n```",
