    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef numberOfPowerfulInt(start, finish, limit, s):\n    # Convert s to integer for easier comparison\n    suffix_val = int(s)\n    suffix_len = len(s)\n    \n    # If s has digits greater than limit, no powerful integers exist\n    for digit in s:\n        if int(digit) > limit:\n            return 0\n    \n    count = 0\n    \n    # Determine the minimum number of digits needed\n    min_digits = max(suffix_len, len(str(start)))\n    max_digits = len(str(finish))\n    \n    # Check if we can have any numbers with the given suffix\n    if suffix_val > finish:\n        return 0\n        \n    # Generate candidates by adding digits to the left of s\n    # Start with the suffix itself\n    current = suffix_val\n    \n    # Check if the suffix itself is within range and valid\n    if start <= current <= finish:\n        # Verify all digits are <= limit (already checked for suffix, but check leading digits)\n        if all(int(d) <= limit for d in str(current)):\n            count += 1\n    \n    # Build numbers by adding digits to the left\n    multiplier = 10 ** suffix_len\n    \n    # Try adding digits to the left\n    for num_digits in range(suffix_len + 1, max_digits + 1):\n        # Calculate the range of prefixes we can have\n        min_prefix = 10 ** (num_digits - suffix_len - 1) if num_digits > suffix_len else 1\n        max_prefix = min(10 ** (num_digits - suffix_len) - 1, finish // multiplier)\n        \n        if min_prefix > max_prefix:\n            continue\n            \n        # Count valid prefixes for this digit length\n        for prefix in range(min_prefix, max_prefix + 1):\n            candidate = prefix * multiplier + suffix_val\n            \n            # Check if candidate is in range\n            if candidate < start:\n                continue\n            if candidate > finish:\n                break\n                \n            # Check if all digits in prefix are <= limit\n            if all(int(d) <= limit for d in str(prefix)):\n                # The suffix digits are already known to be valid\n                count += 1\n    \n    return count\n```",
