      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minimumAddedCoins(coins, target):\n    coins.sort()\n    obtainable = 0  # Maximum obtainable sum\n    added = 0\n    i = 0\n    \n    while obtainable < target:\n        # If current coin can extend our range, use it\n        if i < len(coins) and coins[i] <= obtainable + 1:\n            obtainable += coins[i]\n            i += 1\n        else:\n            # Add a new coin with value (obtainable + 1)\n            obtainable += (obtainable + 1)\n            added += 1\n    \n    return added\n```",
