      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumPrimeDifference(nums):\n    def is_prime(n):\n        if n < 2:\n            return False\n        if n == 2:\n            return True\n        if n % 2 == 0:\n            return False\n        for i in range(3, int(n**0.5) + 1, 2):\n            if n % i == 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n    \n    # Find all indices of prime numbers\n    prime_indices = []\n    for i in range(len(nums)):\n        if is_prime(nums[i]):\n            prime_indices.append(i)\n    \n    # Return the maximum distance between any two prime indices\n    return prime_indices[-1] - prime_indices[0]\n```",
