      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solution(nums, queries):\n    n = len(nums)\n    marked = [False] * n\n    total_sum = sum(nums)\n    marked_sum = 0\n    \n    # Create a list of (value, index) pairs and sort them\n    # Sort by value first, then by index to handle ties\n    indexed_nums = [(nums[i], i) for i in range(n)]\n    indexed_nums.sort()\n    \n    # Keep track of which elements from sorted list have been processed\n    next_available = 0\n    \n    result = []\n    \n    for index, k in queries:\n        # Mark the element at index if not already marked\n        if not marked[index]:\n            marked[index] = True\n            marked_sum += nums[index]\n            total_sum -= nums[index]\n        \n        # Mark k unmarked elements with smallest values (and smallest indices in case of ties)\n        marked_count = 0\n        while marked_count < k and next_available < n:\n            value, idx = indexed_nums[next_available]\n            if not marked[idx]:\n                marked[idx] = True\n                marked_sum += value\n                total_sum -= value\n                marked_count += 1\n            next_available += 1\n        \n        result.append(total_sum)\n    \n    return result\n```",
