      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef sumIndicesWithKSetBits(nums, k):\n    total = 0\n    for i in range(len(nums)):\n        # Count the number of set bits in the binary representation of index i\n        bit_count = bin(i).count('1')\n        # If the count equals k, add the corresponding element to the sum\n        if bit_count == k:\n            total += nums[i]\n    return total\n```",
