      "generated_answer": "To determine if the decision was good, calculate revenue before and after. Original revenue: $350 × 1,000 = $350,000. New revenue: $320 × 1,080 = $345,600. Revenues decreased, but without knowing costs, we cannot determine profit impact—however, since revenues declined and production costs per unit are unchanged (so total costs increased due to more units), profits likely decreased. Thus, the decision reduced revenues and likely harmed profits.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
